where in going to the second line we have used the projectivity of the
measurements $\{\hat{M}^{(\Line, W), \line}_f\}$ and
$\{\hat{M}^{(\Point, W), u}_{a}\}$.
Thus, we have deduced that
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:qld-comm-line-1}
